/**
 * SOVANN FARM — Task 2-b: brand photography batch ORCHESTRATOR.
 *
 * Generates 39 brand photographs into /home/z/my-project/public/images/.
 *
 * Architecture: this orchestrator holds NO heavy deps (no sharp, no SDK) so it
 * survives native crashes; each image is generated by a short-lived child
 * process `bun run scripts/gen-one.ts <jobIndex>` (z-ai-web-dev-sdk + sharp).
 * A crashed/hung child only loses one image and is retried.
 *
 * - Concurrency: 3 (promise pool over child processes)
 * - Retries: up to 2 per image per pass (3 attempts total); 429 responses get longer backoff
 * - Passes: 1 main pass + up to 2 verification passes for missing/undersized files
 * - Idempotent: already-generated files (>=10KB) are skipped on relaunch
 *
 * Launch: `cd /home/z/my-project && nohup bun run scripts/generate-images.ts > scripts/image-gen.log 2>&1 &`
 * (stdout IS scripts/image-gen.log — single writer, no duplication)
 */
